| REQ_ATTR_01a | The attribute output of MIO pad `p` shall equal, in field `invert`, what `MIO_PAD_ATTR_p` reads back. | [`MIO_PAD_ATTR.invert`](../registers.md#mio_pad_attr); [Type RW HWExt](../../../../../../util/reggen/README.md#type-rw-hwext); [Generic Pad Wrapper](../theory_of_operation.md#generic-pad-wrapper) | `pad_attr`: *pad gets read-back* | In every cycle the check compares field `invert` of `mio_attr_o` for the pad with the same field of what a read of `MIO_PAD_ATTR_p` returns. A pad that inverts while the register reads 0, or the reverse, or takes the bit a cycle late, fails it. |
| REQ_ATTR_01b | The attribute output of MIO pad `p` shall equal, in field `virtual_od_en`, what `MIO_PAD_ATTR_p` reads back. | [`MIO_PAD_ATTR.virtual_od_en`](../registers.md#mio_pad_attr); [Type RW HWExt](../../../../../../util/reggen/README.md#type-rw-hwext); [Generic Pad Wrapper](../theory_of_operation.md#generic-pad-wrapper) | `pad_attr`: *pad gets read-back* | In every cycle the check compares field `virtual_od_en` of the pad's `mio_attr_o` with the same field of the read-back of `MIO_PAD_ATTR_p`. A pad that gets a virtual open drain the register does not show, or loses one it shows, fails it. |
