| REQ_STRAP_06 | A TAP strap never sampled since the last full reset shall read 0. (*RTL*) | [Strap Sampling and TAP Isolation](../theory_of_operation.md#strap-sampling-and-tap-isolation); [top_${topname}_pinmux.ipconfig.hjson `enable_strap_sampling`](../../data/top_${topname}_pinmux.ipconfig.hjson) | `strap`: *unsampled strap reads 0*, *pulse samples the straps*, *straps hold* | The check _unsampled strap reads 0_ (CHK_STRAP_04) asserts both straps 0 in full reset and in every cycle after it until a sample, whatever the pads carry; a strap that leaves reset at 1, or takes a pad with no sample, fails it. A strap 1 that a PROD boot leaves unsampled keeps that 0 through the kept half of _pulse samples the straps_ (CHK_STRAP_01) and through _straps hold_ (CHK_STRAP_03). |
